  "content": "\n\n<h1>由 Coffee 製作的原版風格 PBR 材質包</h1>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><strong>需求：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>OptiFine 或 Iris Shaders</em></strong></p>\n<p><em><strong>請確認您的光影是否支援 LabPBR</strong></em></p>\n<p><em><strong>支援 PBR 功能的光影包，例如 Nostalgia Shaders、BSL Shaders 或 Kappa Shaders。</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><em><strong>如果您喜歡我製作的材質包，可以考慮贊助我一杯飲料，以支持 CoffeePBR 材質包的長期更新。您可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fifdian.net%252fa%252fCoffeeXiaoGuan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">愛發電</a> 上贊助我。</strong></em></h2>\n<h1><em><strong>希望大家喜歡我的材質包</strong></em></h1>\n<p><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8540790b-ece9-4836-8167-c4e958238f1a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_71ea77b4-ee21-4214-b413-2ee7b44ec729.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_45bcbfd9-8ac1-4b3e-b687-89b1e6b628f6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"455\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b9f8eb26-8c3b-42cc-bec0-48cac661c730.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9560c0a3-b1c8-4d40-acba-2cda351e175f.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></em></p>",
